Description:

Implements JMAP Object Metadata (draft-ietf-jmap-metadata-05): the
metadata and privateMetadata properties on Mailbox, Email, Calendar,
CalendarEvent, AddressBook, ContactCard and SieveScript, with their /get,
/set, /copy, /changes and /query extensions, and the maySetMetadata right
on Mailbox, Calendar and AddressBook.


Documentation:

docsrc/rfc-support.rst


Config changes:

None


Upgrade instructions:

None.  Each metadata namespace is stored in the annotation
/vendor/cmu/cyrus-imapd/jmapmetadata/<namespace>, shared for metadata and
private for privateMetadata, which only admins may write over IMAP.  It
counts against the ANNOTATION-STORAGE quota.


